0	section	Starting off
1	line	Cook	What am I to do?
1	option	What's wrong?
2	line	Player	What's wrong?
2	line	Cook	Oh dear, oh dear, oh dear, I'm in a terrible terrible mess! It's the Duke's birthday today, and I should be making him a lovely big birthday cake.
2	line	Cook	I've forgotten to buy the ingredients. I'll never get them in time now. He'll sack me! What will I do? I have four children and a goat to look after. Would you help me? Please?
2	select	Start the Cook's Assistant quest?
2	option	Yes.
3	line	Player	Yes, I'll help you.
3	line	Cook	Oh thank you, thank you. I need milk, an egg and flour. I'd be very grateful if you can get them for me.
3	cond	If the player already has the necessary items:
4	line	Player	I have all of those ingredients on me already!
4	line	Cook	That's an odd coincidence... Were you planning on making a cake too?
4	line	Player	Not exactly. I just had an odd feeling you might be needing these ingredients. If I see a cook, I presume there's food of some kind! Lucky guess I suppose.
4	line	Cook	Well thank you! Hand them over, please.
4	box	You hand the cook all of the ingredients.
4	line	Cook	You've brought me everything I need! I am saved! Thank you!
4	line	Player	So do I get to go to the Duke's Party?
4	line	Cook	I'm afraid not, only the big cheeses get to dine with the Duke.
4	line	Player	Well, maybe one day I'll be important enough to sit on the Duke's table.
4	line	Cook	Maybe, but I won't be holding my breath.
4	action	end
3	cond	If the player doesn't have the necessary items:
4	line	Player	So where do I find these ingredients then?
4	option	Where do I find some flour?
5	line	Cook	There is a Mill fairly close, go North and then West. Mill Lane Mill is just off the road to Draynor. I usually get my flour from there.
5	cond	If the player has an empty pot with them:
6	line	Cook	Talk to Millie, she'll help, she's a lovely girl and a fine Miller. Make sure you take a pot with you for the flour though, you've got one on you already.
6	action	other
5	cond	If the player does not have an empty pot with them:
6	line	Cook	Talk to Millie, she'll help, she's a lovely girl and a fine Miller. Make sure you take a pot with you for the flour though, there should be one on the table in here.
6	action	other
4	option	How about milk?
5	line	Cook	There is a cattle field on the other side of the river, just across the road from the Groats' Farm.
5	line	Cook	Talk to Gillie Groats, she looks after the Dairy cows - she'll tell you everything you need to know about milking cows!
5	cond	If the player has an empty bucket with them:
6	line	Cook	You'll need an empty bucket for the milk itself. I do see you've got a bucket with you already luckily!
6	action	other
5	cond	If the player does not have an empty bucket with them:
6	line	Cook	You'll need an empty bucket for the milk itself. The general store just north of the castle will sell you one for a couple of coins.
6	action	other
4	option	And eggs? Where are they found?
5	line	Cook	I normally get my eggs from the Groats' farm, on the other side of the river.
5	line	Cook	But any chicken should lay eggs.
